Minor architectural cleanup: ``Loader.load()`` now re-evaluates ``when=`` conditions on every call and auto-clears the cache when the enabled-source set changes; ``DatureConfigError.__init__`` accepts ``BaseException`` items to avoid silent type-ignore; ``Loader._debug`` renamed to public ``Loader.debug``; ``should_skip_broken`` documents that ``when=False`` takes priority over ``skip_if_broken``; ``conditional_sources.md`` gains a section on ``when=``/``skip_if_broken`` precedence.
